{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2021-04-07 10:15:00', 'title': 'AIR PRODUCTS UNVEILS HYDROGEN FUELING STATION IN ULSAN, SOUTH KOREA', 'text': 'LEHIGH VALLEY, PA., APRIL 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE:APD) ANNOUNCED TODAY IT RECENTLY OPENED A NEW HYDROGEN FUELING STATION AT ITS INDUSTRIAL GASES FACILITY IN ULSAN CITY, SOUTH KOREA.'}